BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:May Day 2026: Worker Power March!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260501T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260501T180000
UID:c1aa7287761253fb37c8e90a9434b8c1@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/MainMayDayPoster050126_20260417225703073285.png
DESCRIPTION:On the frontline of economic\, political\, and climate crisis\
 , farmworkers have chosen to STAND UP and FIGHT BACK! This MAY DAY\, farmw
 orkers are leading the way through el pueblo calling on the community to j
 oin the fight\, organize\, and leverage worker power! Join *Indivisible So
 noma County* in solidarity! The March will start at Southwest Community Pa
 rk and end at Julliard Park. Shuttle service is provided for those who can
 't or are limited from walking.
LOCATION:Virtual event
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/indivisiblesonomacounty/event/941330/
X-SOURCE:Indivisible Sonoma County (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
