 ploads/event/260420_EYES-ON-ICE-Train-the-Trainer_20260326161721518442.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Abusive immigration enforcement poses a threat to us all but p
 laces non-citizens at particular risk. This session will equip participant
 s to train others on core Know Your Rights topics such as the right to rem
 ain silent\, the right to refuse to consent to searches\, and the right to
  record ICE and other law enforcement officials. We will also cover best p
 ractices for reducing risks when exercising rights. Ojo con ICE: Entrenami
 ento para Entrenadores\, Derechos de las Personas Inmigrantes Evento Vi
LOCATION:Virtual event
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/nokings/event/926205/
X-SOURCE:Indivisible Sonoma County (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
